<title>USA: U.S. vegoil product output/stocks - Census. [CORRECTED 00:43 GMT 1/8]</title>
<headline>U.S. vegoil product output/stocks - Census. [CORRECTED 00:43 GMT 1/8]</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census Bureau reported</p>
<p>selected edible product output as follows (Mln Lbs)</p>
<p>				   June 97     May 97   June 96</p>
<p>   Baking or Frying Fats     464.7     472.1	470.3</p>
<p>   Soy Salad/Cooking Oil     465.1     504.2-R    414.6</p>
<p> Other Salad/Cooking Oil     111.7     106.7	106.8</p>
<p>		   Margarine     180.5     178.7-R    181.1</p>
<p>	   Glycerine Crude	29.6	25.7-R     29.8</p>
<p>		     Refined	29.5	25.4-R     29.8</p>
<p>		 Fatty Acids     149.8     138.2	145.5</p>
<p>	 Meat/Meal Tankage     457.9     474.2-R    456.8</p>
<p>PRODUCER/WAREHOUSE STOCKS OF SELECTED EDIBLE PRODUCTS:</p>
<p>		  (Mln Lbs) --   June 97   May 97   June 96</p>
<p>    Baking and Frying Fats    99.1     95.7	 93.7</p>
<p> Soybean Salad/Cooking Oil    64.9     78.1-R     63.8</p>
<p>   Other Salad/Cooking Oil    32.1     43.0-R     38.4</p>
<p>		     Margarine    51.4     49.1-R     46.0</p>
<p>	     Glycerine Crude    66.6     65.7-R     53.5</p>
<p>	   Glycerine Refined    12.4     11.7-R     24.0</p>
<p>   (Corrects refined glycerine stocks figure for June '97 from</p>
<p>    42.6 million pounds)</p>
<p>		   Fatty Acids   105.0     95.9	109.1</p>
